{"id":"50d0cf46cc3d9450","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cnf-tree-production-count.md","title":"CNF 解析树的节点与推导长度","display":"thm-cnf-tree-production-count — CNF 解析树的节点与推导长度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cnf-tree-production-count","aliases":["73-thm-cnf-tree-production-count"],"display":"thm-cnf-tree-production-count — CNF 解析树的节点与推导长度","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]","[[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.2.1, print pp. 279–281; PDF pp. 301–303; exact local counting refinement","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cnf-tree-production-count"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cnf-tree-production-count</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cnf-tree-production-count — CNF 解析树的节点与推导长度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd76b0e857c90848\" href=\"?note=cd76b0e857c90848\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf\">73-df-epsilon-free-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b4cb7350d4f0995\" href=\"?note=4b4cb7350d4f0995\" title=\"73-df-cfg-tree-yield\">73-df-cfg-tree-yield</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.2.1, print pp. 279–281; PDF pp. 301–303; exact local counting refinement"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^+\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=(D,\\ell)\">\\(t=(D,\\ell)\\)</span> 为根标记 S、产出 w 的完整解析树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_D\">\\(\\kappa_D\\)</span> 采用已列树定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\{d\\in D:\\kappa_D(d)=2\\}|=|w|-1,\\qquad\n|\\{d\\in D:\\ell(d)\\in V\\}|=2|w|-1,\\qquad\n|D|=3|w|-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\{d\\in D:\\kappa_D(d)=2\\}|=|w|-1,\\qquad\n|\\{d\\in D:\\ell(d)\\in V\\}|=2|w|-1,\\qquad\n|D|=3|w|-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把每个 A→a 的单边收缩，剩下一棵有 |w| 个叶的满二叉树，所以二叉节点 |w|−1。每个终结符叶另有一个 A→a 节点，共有 2|w|−1 次产生式应用；再加终结符叶得到 3|w|−1 个节点。这里不把总树节点数误写成推导步骤数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"cd76b0e857c90848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-tree-yield","status":"resolved","id":"4b4cb7350d4f0995","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^+","display":false},{"tex":"t=(D,\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_D","display":false},{"tex":"|\\{d\\in D:\\kappa_D(d)=2\\}|=|w|-1,\\qquad\n|\\{d\\in D:\\ell(d)\\in V\\}|=2|w|-1,\\qquad\n|D|=3|w|-1.","display":true}],"bytes":1407,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-cnf-tree-production-count|CNF 解析树的节点与推导长度]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["cd76b0e857c90848","4b4cb7350d4f0995"]}